@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Class structure — Sign in with a link
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide empty members

class SignInToken {
  +Guid Id
  +Guid MemberId
  +string TokenHash
  +DateTimeOffset IssuedOn
  +DateTimeOffset ExpiresOn
  +DateTimeOffset? ConsumedOn
  +IsRedeemable(DateTimeOffset) : bool
  +Consume(DateTimeOffset) : void
}
class RequestSignInLinkCommand {
  +string EmailAddress
}
class ExchangeSignInTokenCommand {
  +string Token
}
class Session {
  +Guid Id
  +Guid MemberId
  +Guid CongregationId
  +DateTimeOffset OpenedOn
  +DateTimeOffset? RevokedOn
  +IsLive(DateTimeOffset) : bool
}
class SessionResult {
  +Guid SessionId
  +string AccessToken
  +string RefreshToken
  +DateTimeOffset ExpiresOn
}
class JwtIssuer {
  +Issue(Member, Session) : SessionResult
}
interface IAuthenticationStore {
  +FindMemberByEmailAddress(string) : Member
  +FindSignInTokenByHash(string) : SignInToken
}
interface IEmailSender {
  +SendSignInLink(string, string) : Task
}
class Member {
  +Guid Id
  +Guid CongregationId
  +string EmailAddress
  +MemberRole Role
  +MemberState State
}
class TokenAlreadyConsumedException {
  +Guid TokenId
}

SignInToken --> Member : identifies
Session --> Member : opened for
RequestSignInLinkCommand ..> SignInToken : results in
ExchangeSignInTokenCommand ..> SignInToken : consumes atomically
ExchangeSignInTokenCommand ..> Session : opens
SignInToken ..> TokenAlreadyConsumedException : raises on reuse
JwtIssuer --> SessionResult : returns
JwtIssuer ..> Session : stamps the sid claim from
IAuthenticationStore ..> Member : finds without a congregation filter
IAuthenticationStore ..> SignInToken : finds by hash
IEmailSender ..> SignInToken : delivers
@enduml
